{
  "profile": "aps-chain-selection-no-union-v0",
  "status": "candidate_against_proposed",
  "description": "One leaf agent L holds independently rooted AuthorityDelegationV1 chains: one granting read of resource 1, one granting write of resource 2, each with an equal bounded spend ceiling of 5 in the same unit, plus a third chain that also grants read of resource 1 and is used only by the fallback vectors. Each vector names the one chain the action selected, the full set of chains the agent has stored, and a revocation answer for every stored chain. Every vector is decided under four named policies: single_chain, the conformant one, and union_pooled, union_axis and silent_fallback, three models of specific non-conformant behaviors this family exists to discriminate. Only single_chain's column is a claim about the reference SDKs. See README.md, sections 'Decision policies' and 'What a pass establishes'.",
  "proposed_text": {
    "document": "aeoess/agent-authority-lifecycle, AUTHORITY-LIFECYCLE.md",
    "commit": "5c1bf09ee29d517f2f19c9bb9212543a7c44b227",
    "sections": {
      "L5": "L5. Independent chains are not combined",
      "L11": "L11. No silent authority resurrection"
    }
  },
  "policies": {
    "single_chain": "Conformant. Verify the selected chain alone; require every needed grant to be covered by a grant on that chain's leaf; reserve the amount against that chain alone with InMemoryAuthorityBudgetLedger. Nothing else the agent holds is read.",
    "union_pooled": "Non-conformant model, authored by this fixture. Verify every stored chain, pool the leaf scope grants of the valid ones as a set, sum their per_action ceilings in the action's unit, and decide against the pool.",
    "union_axis": "Non-conformant model, authored by this fixture. union_pooled, except that scope coverage splits each pooled grant at its last colon and unions the resource prefixes and the action suffixes as independent axes, so the pool admits a resource-and-action pair neither chain ever granted.",
    "silent_fallback": "Non-conformant model, authored by this fixture. single_chain on the selected chain; if that does not return valid, retry the agent's other stored chains in stored order and return the first valid result, reporting no switch of its own."
  },
